---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="页面未找到" description="此地址没有对应的 jubeat 音乐魔方 WIKI 页面。"><section class="notfound w-panel"><span class="w-brand-logo-frame"><img class="w-brand-logo w-brand-logo--hero" src="/brand/jubeat-music-cube-logo.webp" alt="jubeat 音乐魔方"/></span><h1>这一格还没有点亮。</h1><p>页面不存在或路径已经变更。不会自动跳转，请选择下一步。</p><form action="/songs/"><label for="missing-search">搜索曲目</label><input id="missing-search" class="w-field" name="q" placeholder="输入曲名或 artist"/><button>前往曲目库</button></form><nav aria-label="404 快捷入口"><a href="/songs/">曲目库</a><a href="/jubility/">数据</a><a href="/versions/">图鉴</a><a href="/about/">关于</a></nav></section></Layout><style>.notfound{max-width:720px;margin:var(--w-s-12) auto;text-align:center}.notfound h1{font-family:var(--w-font-display);font-size:var(--w-fs-3xl)}.notfound form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:var(--w-s-2);margin:var(--w-s-5) 0}.notfound label{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:left}.notfound button{border:1px solid var(--w-hit-deep);border-radius:var(--w-r-sm);background:var(--w-hit);font-weight:800}.notfound nav{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:var(--w-s-4)}@media(max-width:500px){.notfound form{grid-template-columns:1fr}.notfound button{min-height:var(--w-tap)}}</style>
